07  OPEN TO WORK: NEVER TURN IT ON FOR EVERYONE


The green Open to Work banner is visible to your current employer, your clients, and every person in your network. The moment you turn it on for everyone, you signal that you are available and possibly not by choice. That is not the signal you want to send.

The right way to do it
Do NOT do this
Open to Work for All LinkedIn Members. The green ring shows on your photo publicly. Your boss can see it.
Do this instead
Open to Work for Recruiters only. Shows inside Sales Navigator. No green banner. Nobody else knows.


How to set it
Go to your LinkedIn profile
Click Open to and select Finding a new job
Under who can see you are open, select Recruiters only
Fill in the job types and locations you actually want
Save

Quick Action
Check your Open to Work setting right now. If it is set to All LinkedIn Members, switch it to Recruiters only. Takes 60 seconds.


